Raspberry Pi driver for a 1.44-inch TFT display (ST7735S, 128x128) over 4-wire SPI.

Wiring (BCM numbering):
  RST  -> GPIO18
  DC   -> GPIO22
  LED  -> GPIO23
  SPI  -> CE0 (bus 0, device 0), SCLK=GPIO11, MOSI=GPIO10

The script initializes the display, renders a few test patterns, and cleans up
GPIO and SPI resources on exit.
